comments.body:
[suggestion]

- Remove the extra comment `Normalize CSS ...`. The function name clearly describes what it does.
- Reduce the number of `node.walk()` calls for performance.

```suggestion
	normalizeNodeEscaping(node);
	normalizeSelectorNodeWhitespaceAndComments(node);

	node.walk((child) => {
		normalizeNodeEscaping(child);
		normalizeSelectorNodeWhitespaceAndComments(child);
	});
```

